			"id":"e527dc3b4a2ba277",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Info\n\nThere are eight letters with eight jewels.\n\nSeems to be related to the [[Ruby Crown.canvas|Ruby Crown]], an item that was stolen from a Museum or something.\n\nLetter Locations\n- 1st Letter - [[Red Door Area.canvas|Red Door Area]] - [[Underpass.canvas|Underpass]]\n- 2nd Letter - [[026 - Study.canvas|026 - Study]]\n- 4th Letter - [[Boudoir.canvas|Boudoir]]\n- 5th Letter - [[030 - Drafting Studio.canvas|030 - Drafting Studio]]\n- 6th Letter - [[025 - Drawing Room.canvas|025 - Drawing Room]]\n- 7th Letter - [[Shelter.canvas|Shelter]]\n- 8th Letter - [[024 - Office.canvas|024 - Office]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
